  "prefLabel": "Per-A 102.08 Declaratory ruling",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per-A 102.08 “Declaratory ruling” means a decision by the board \"as to the specific applicability of any statutory provision or of any rule or order\" of the board in accordance with RSA 541-A:1, V.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Per-A 100) #7377, eff 10-23-00",
